{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":18,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["神要责罚古实"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"唉！古实河外翅膀刷刷响声之地，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"差遣使者在水面上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坐蒲草船过海。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知说：你们快行的使者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要到高大光滑的民那里去。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自从开国以来，那民极其可畏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是分地界践踏人的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的地有江河分开。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"世上一切的居民和地上所住的人哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山上竖立大旗的时候你们要看；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吹角的时候你们要听。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华对我这样说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要安静，在我的居所观看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同日光中的清热，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如露水的云雾在收割的热天。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收割之先，花开已谢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"花也成了将熟的葡萄；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必用镰刀削去嫩枝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又砍掉蔓延的枝条，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要撇给山间的鸷鸟和地上的野兽。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"夏天，鸷鸟要宿在其上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"冬天，野兽都卧在其中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"到那时，这高大光滑的民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是从开国以来极其可畏、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"分地界践踏人的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的地有江河分开；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必将礼物奉给万军之耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是奉到锡安山—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华安置他名的地方。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/18.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/19.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/17.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}